<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Fire Mages</span></h2>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear available from all PvE sources after the Celestial dungeons corresponding to Throne of Thunder LFR gear is made available. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<br/>
<br/>It's also relevant that although some of these items are listed as pre-raid best, they're available only through either Tailoring or Reputations which can be a lot to ask of new characters and/<wbr/>or alts considering the RDF gear available through Celestial Dungeons performs relatively close - meaning if you don't want to farm said gear, just get the closest item from the Celestial vendor.<br/>
<br/>
<div class="exclude-units">
