<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Fire Mages</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_mount_triceratopsmount_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is one of the two newest world bosses, and it drops some very good items, although these aren't listed on the set at the top of the page, they're more often than not better than what's listed. Because they're so hard to obtain consistently, they're excluded, instead feel free to use use the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowsims.com/mop/mage/fire/#" target="_blank">Fire Sim</a> to check whether or not it's an upgrade.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a></b>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
