<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Similarly to Sha of Anger in the past two phases, Nalak drops Tier and PVP items - though this is the upgraded version, meaning it drops 522 Tier 15 items and Season 13 496 PVP pieces.<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nalak</span></a></b>
