<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95260/gloves-of-the-chromatic-hydra">
<img alt="Gloves of the Chromatic Hydra" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidmage_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Chromatic Hydra</span></a></div></li>
