<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a> is one of four available world bosses in Phase 3, it provides a few okay items for Fire Mages, which were not listed in the sets above because of how rare they are to obtain, but if you do manage to obtain them, they might be worth using since they're item level 496 and upgradeable by 8 item levels using the ilvl upgrade system, landing them at 504 ilvl (similar to Throne of Thunder Celestial gear).<br/>
<br/>
<b>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a></b>
<ul class="exclude-units">
