<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has their own unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50338/kornas-nightsavage">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kor'nas Nightsavage</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87642/darkstaff-of-annihilation">
<img alt="Darkstaff of Annihilation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkstaff of Annihilation</span></a>, an ilvl-420 weapon.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50768/cournith-waterstrider">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90721/cournith-waterstriders-silken-finery">
<img alt="Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery</span></a>, ilvl-440 legs.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c8" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Fire Mages</span></h2>As Fire in Phase 3, only the Shado-Pan Assault items are relevant, assuming you're gearing up from already having most of the Phase 2 best in slot gear. And since you can get friendly relatively easily via the Isle of Thunder before raid, those items are great options to use as temporary upgrades.<br/>
<br/>The rest of the reputations are now mostly obsolete due to the Celestial Dungeon gear being so much easier to obtain.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
